<title>FRANCE: All-cargo aircraft up share of Paris air cargo mkt.</title>
<headline>All-cargo aircraft up share of Paris air cargo mkt.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-freighters share of global air cargo traffic handled at the Paris airports between January and November 1996 was up 0.4 percentage points on the same period last year, Aeroports de Paris (ADP) figures show.</p>
<p>Full-freighters had a 39.6 percent share of  the ADP s January-November 1996 global air cargo throughput (imports and exports) totalling 1,013,379 tonnes, compared to 39.2 percent in the same period in 1995. -- Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
